  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 0.0,
      "e": 1.57,
      "text": "MARS REPORT: UPDATE ON"
    },
    {
      "s": 1.57,
      "e": 2.9,
      "text": "PERSEVERANCE AND INGENUITY"
    },
    {
      "s": 2.9,
      "e": 4.04,
      "text": "April 16, 2021"
    },
    {
      "s": 4.5,
      "e": 6.81,
      "text": "NASA's Mars 2020 Perseverance"
    },
    {
      "s": 6.81,
      "e": 8.57,
      "text": "Rover and the Ingenuity Mars"
    },
    {
      "s": 8.57,
      "e": 10.21,
      "text": "Helicopter have been busy"
    },
    {
      "s": 10.21,
      "e": 12.11,
      "text": "after landing on the Red Planet"
    },
    {
      "s": 12.11,
      "e": 13.48,
      "text": "a few weeks ago."
    },
    {
      "s": 13.81,
      "e": 15.21,
      "text": "Today we are joined by"
    },
    {
      "s": 15.21,
      "e": 16.98,
      "text": "Perseverance project scientist"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.98,
      "e": 18.45,
      "text": "Ken Farley and"
    },
    {
      "s": 18.45,
      "e": 20.09,
      "text": "Ingenuity Chief Engineer"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.09,
      "e": 21.89,
      "text": "Bob Balaram to get an"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.89,
      "e": 23.26,
      "text": "update on what’s happening"
    },
    {
      "s": 23.26,
      "e": 24.49,
      "text": "with the rover and"
    },
    {
      "s": 24.49,
      "e": 25.86,
      "text": "the helicopter."
    },
    {
      "s": 26.06,
      "e": 27.19,
      "text": "Bob, can you give us the"
    },
    {
      "s": 27.23,
      "e": 29.0,
      "text": "latest update on Ingenuity?"
    },
    {
      "s": 30.7,
      "e": 32.23,
      "text": "Yes, we have been working"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.23,
      "e": 33.83,
      "text": "on a fix to a problem that has"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.83,
      "e": 35.2,
      "text": "prevented us from going into"
    },
    {
      "s": 35.2,
      "e": 36.47,
      "text": "flight mode, where we can"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.47,
      "e": 38.14,
      "text": "spin the rotors up fast."
    },
    {
      "s": 38.14,
      "e": 39.97,
      "text": "We have both a long-term fix"
    },
    {
      "s": 39.97,
      "e": 41.21,
      "text": "that’s making its way to the"
    },
    {
      "s": 41.21,
      "e": 42.58,
      "text": "spacecraft as well as some"
    },
    {
      "s": 42.58,
      "e": 44.51,
      "text": "workarounds that we sent"
    },
    {
      "s": 44.51,
      "e": 45.48,
      "text": "on Thursday."
    },
    {
      "s": 45.48,
      "e": 46.81,
      "text": "And we just got the results"
    },
    {
      "s": 46.81,
      "e": 47.85,
      "text": "on Friday and we will"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.85,
      "e": 49.78,
      "text": "be analyzing those results to"
    },
    {
      "s": 49.78,
      "e": 52.05,
      "text": "see what the high speed spin"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.05,
      "e": 53.49,
      "text": "looked like."
    },
    {
      "s": 53.49,
      "e": 54.92,
      "text": "And that should let us"
    },
    {
      "s": 54.92,
      "e": 56.52,
      "text": "get back on track with our"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.52,
      "e": 58.42,
      "text": "rest of our flight experiments."
    },
    {
      "s": 59.59,
      "e": 60.59,
      "text": "And what does that mean"
    },
    {
      "s": 60.59,
      "e": 61.76,
      "text": "for first flight?"
    },
    {
      "s": 63.2,
      "e": 65.03,
      "text": "I think it means that we’ll"
    },
    {
      "s": 65.03,
      "e": 65.7,
      "text": "be done with the"
    },
    {
      "s": 65.7,
      "e": 66.63,
      "text": "commissioning if the"
    },
    {
      "s": 66.63,
      "e": 67.73,
      "text": "results from this all look"
    },
    {
      "s": 67.73,
      "e": 68.97,
      "text": "good and we’ll then be"
    },
    {
      "s": 68.97,
      "e": 70.3,
      "text": "really be ready to take off"
    },
    {
      "s": 70.3,
      "e": 71.3,
      "text": "on that first flight"
    },
    {
      "s": 71.3,
      "e": 72.41,
      "text": "So it’s good progress"
    },
    {
      "s": 72.41,
      "e": 74.07,
      "text": "to have and we’re looking"
    },
    {
      "s": 74.07,
      "e": 75.67,
      "text": "forward to being in the"
    },
    {
      "s": 75.67,
      "e": 77.41,
      "text": "flying phase and getting past"
    },
    {
      "s": 77.41,
      "e": 78.98,
      "text": "the commissioning phase."
    },
    {
      "s": 79.34,
      "e": 80.48,
      "text": "That’s good to hear Bob."
    },
    {
      "s": 80.48,
      "e": 82.61,
      "text": "Now Ken, there’s another"
    },
    {
      "s": 82.61,
      "e": 83.98,
      "text": "technology demonstration"
    },
    {
      "s": 83.98,
      "e": 85.39,
      "text": "gearing up on Perseverance"
    },
    {
      "s": 85.39,
      "e": 87.15,
      "text": "can you tell us about MOXIE"
    },
    {
      "s": 87.15,
      "e": 89.29,
      "text": "and what it plans to do?"
    },
    {
      "s": 90.09,
      "e": 90.76,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "s": 90.89,
      "e": 93.13,
      "text": "MOXIE is part of Perseverance’s"
    },
    {
      "s": 93.13,
      "e": 94.53,
      "text": "technology demonstration"
    },
    {
      "s": 94.53,
      "e": 96.86,
      "text": "payload, as is the helicopter."
    },
    {
      "s": 96.86,
      "e": 99.87,
      "text": "And MOXIE is a small device"
    },
    {
      "s": 99.87,
      "e": 101.8,
      "text": "that will convert the carbon"
    },
    {
      "s": 101.8,
      "e": 102.77,
      "text": "dioxide of the Martian"
    },
    {
      "s": 102.77,
      "e": 104.84,
      "text": "atmosphere into oxygen"
    },
    {
      "s": 104.84,
      "e": 106.91,
      "text": "as a demonstration of this"
    },
    {
      "s": 106.91,
      "e": 109.24,
      "text": "capability for future missions"
    },
    {
      "s": 109.24,
      "e": 110.28,
      "text": "that might bring astronauts"
    },
    {
      "s": 110.28,
      "e": 112.05,
      "text": "to Mars who would benefit"
    },
    {
      "s": 112.05,
      "e": 113.45,
      "text": "greatly by not having to"
    },
    {
      "s": 113.45,
      "e": 114.85,
      "text": "bring oxygen with them."
    },
    {
      "s": 114.85,
      "e": 117.05,
      "text": "So MOXIE is a demonstration"
    },
    {
      "s": 117.05,
      "e": 118.32,
      "text": "that this capability will"
    },
    {
      "s": 118.32,
      "e": 120.05,
      "text": "actually work on Mars."
    },
    {
      "s": 120.05,
      "e": 121.22,
      "text": "And we’re very excited"
    },
    {
      "s": 121.22,
      "e": 122.79,
      "text": "as part of the early parts of"
    },
    {
      "s": 122.79,
      "e": 124.12,
      "text": "this mission to be testing"
    },
    {
      "s": 124.12,
      "e": 125.22,
      "text": "out our new technologies"
    },
    {
      "s": 125.22,
      "e": 126.79,
      "text": "and we expect that the"
    },
    {
      "s": 126.79,
      "e": 128.39,
      "text": "first run of the MOXIE"
    },
    {
      "s": 128.39,
      "e": 130.26,
      "text": "investigation will be within"
    },
    {
      "s": 130.26,
      "e": 131.9,
      "text": "the next couple of weeks."
    },
    {
      "s": 132.83,
      "e": 134.73,
      "text": "Great.  And what science"
    },
    {
      "s": 134.73,
      "e": 136.47,
      "text": "has Perseverance been working"
    },
    {
      "s": 136.47,
      "e": 139.37,
      "text": "on over the last week or so?"
    },
    {
      "s": 140.17,
      "e": 142.44,
      "text": "We have been studying rocks as"
    },
    {
      "s": 142.44,
      "e": 144.81,
      "text": "we have been investigating the"
    },
    {
      "s": 144.81,
      "e": 146.31,
      "text": "area where the helicopter is"
    },
    {
      "s": 146.31,
      "e": 147.58,
      "text": "going to fly."
    },
    {
      "s": 147.58,
      "e": 149.31,
      "text": "And as we drove out to our"
    },
    {
      "s": 149.31,
      "e": 151.08,
      "text": "observation point where we can"
    },
    {
      "s": 151.08,
      "e": 152.15,
      "text": "watch the helicopter at a safe"
    },
    {
      "s": 152.15,
      "e": 153.49,
      "text": "distance, we have been exploring"
    },
    {
      "s": 153.49,
      "e": 155.16,
      "text": "the rocks that are up close to"
    },
    {
      "s": 155.16,
      "e": 156.92,
      "text": "the rover, trying to understand"
    },
    {
      "s": 156.92,
      "e": 159.66,
      "text": "whether they are volcanic rocks"
    },
    {
      "s": 159.66,
      "e": 161.03,
      "text": "or sedimentary rocks."
    },
    {
      "s": 161.03,
      "e": 162.26,
      "text": "Were they produced by a volcano"
    },
    {
      "s": 162.26,
      "e": 165.9,
      "text": "or were they deposited by water?"
    },
    {
      "s": 166.23,
      "e": 167.3,
      "text": "Thank you.  Thank you Ken"
    },
    {
      "s": 167.3,
      "e": 168.77,
      "text": "and thank you Bob."
    },
    {
      "s": 168.77,
      "e": 170.6,
      "text": "To get the latest,"
    },
    {
      "s": 170.6,
      "e": 172.5,
      "text": "follow @NASAJPL"
    },
    {
      "s": 172.5,
      "e": 173.87,
      "text": "and @NASAPersevere"
    },
    {
      "s": 173.87,
      "e": 174.81,
      "text": "on social media for the"
    },
    {
      "s": 174.81,
      "e": 175.97,
      "text": "latest updates."
    },
    {
      "s": 175.97,
      "e": 177.74,
      "text": "Take a deeper dive on the"
    },
    {
      "s": 177.74,
      "e": 178.84,
      "text": "mission's website,"
    },
    {
      "s": 178.84,
      "e": 182.05,
      "text": "mars.nasa.gov/perseverance"
    },
    {
      "s": 182.05,
      "e": 183.75,
      "text": "where you can also find all the"
    },
    {
      "s": 183.75,
      "e": 185.82,
      "text": "raw images being sent back by"
    },
    {
      "s": 185.82,
      "e": 187.35,
      "text": "the rover, and go to"
    },
    {
      "s": 187.35,
      "e": 190.99,
      "text": "go.nasa.gov/ingenuity for the"
    },
    {
      "s": 190.99,
      "e": 193.46,
      "text": "latest updates on the helicopter"
    },
    {
      "s": 193.49,
      "e": 195.56,
      "text": "Thanks for watching."
    },
